# fixedbugs, defect 2351, lane b25-pkgc, 2026-11-08.
#
# A fetched package's header that stops the preprocessor: clang cannot list
# what it reads, so nothing vouches that it reads only the package's own
# files, and no compile of it runs (panel 235's R9, its C2), clang's words,
# which could quote a file the header opened before it stopped, unprinted.
use <pk>/pk

function main()
    print(pk.v())
